{"strongs": "H1607", "word": "גָּעַשׁ", "translit": "ga.ash", "root": "געש", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "shake, quake", "definition": "[ גָּעַשׁ ] verb shake, quake (Late Hebrew id. ) — Qal Imperfect וַתִּגְעַשׁ Ps 18:8 a = 2Sam 22:8 a Kt ( Qr Hithpa`el); — quake of earth at theoph., Ps 18:8 = 2Sam 22:8 (read Kt ; || רעשׁ ). Pu`al Imperfect be shaken up, convulsed יְגֹעֲשׁוּעַֿם Job 34:20 a people are convulsed . Hithpa`el shake back and forth, toss or reel to and fro וַיִּתְגָּעַשׁ Qr 2Sam 22:8 a (< Kt Qal ); יִתְגָָּֽעֲשׁוּ Jer 46:7 , וַיִּתְגָָּֽעֲשׁוּ Ps 18:8 b + 2 t.; — of mountains Ps 18:8 b = 2Sam 22:8 b; of waves of sea, Jer 5:22 of waters of Nile Jer 46:7 (compare v Jer 46:8 ). Hithpo`el Perfect וְהִתְגֹּעֲשׁוּ consecutive Jer 25:16 Imperfect יִתְגֹּעֲשׁוּ Jer 46:8 id. of waters of Nile Jer 46:8 of drunken men, reel to and fro , Jer 25:16 (figurative of nations confounded by ׳ י ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1719')\">BDB1719</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1607')\">H1607</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1718')\">BDB1718</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1720')\">BDB1720</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>גָּעַשׁ</bdbheb>] <b>verb</b> <highlightword>shake, quake</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַתִּגְעַשׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 18:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,8)\">Ps 18:8</ref> a = <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,8)\">2Sam 22:8</ref> a <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> Hithpa`el); — <highlight>quake</highlight> of earth at theoph., <ref ref=\"Ps 18:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,8)\">Ps 18:8</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,8)\">2Sam 22:8</ref> (read <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>רעשׁ</bdbheb>). <b>Pu`al</b> <highlight>Imperfect be shaken up, convulsed</highlight> <bdbheb>יְגֹעֲשׁוּעַֿם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 34:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,34,20)\">Job 34:20</ref> <highlight>a people are convulsed</highlight>. <b>Hithpa`el</b> <highlight>shake back and forth, toss</highlight> or <highlight>reel to and fro</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיִּתְגָּעַשׁ</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,8)\">2Sam 22:8</ref> a (&lt; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <b>Qal</b>); <bdbheb>יִתְגָָּֽעֲשׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 46:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,7)\">Jer 46:7</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיִּתְגָָּֽעֲשׁוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 18:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,8)\">Ps 18:8</ref>b + 2 t.; — of mountains <ref ref=\"Ps 18:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,18,8)\">Ps 18:8</ref>b = <ref ref=\"2Sam 22:8\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(10,22,8)\">2Sam 22:8</ref> b; of waves of sea, <ref ref=\"Jer 5:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,5,22)\">Jer 5:22</ref> of waters of Nile <ref ref=\"Jer 46:7\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,7)\">Jer 46:7</ref> (compare v<ref ref=\"Jer 46:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,46,8)\">Jer 46:8</ref>). <b>Hithpo`el</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וְהִתְגֹּעֲשׁוּ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Jer 25:1